<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA+ to Chubu Electric convertible bond.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA+ to Chubu Electric convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Wednesday it had assigned its AA+ rating to the 150 billion yen worth of convertible bonds issued by Chubu Electric Power Co Inc.</p>
<p>The bonds mature on March 31, 2006.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said the rating reflected Chubu Electric Power's very strong position as the monopoly provider of electricity in the Chubu region of central Japan.</p>
</text>
